The '''Barbarian Duke X''' is a hostile {{MobCategory|mb}} that can be found in {{Zone|The Dukedom}} which is located on North side of {{zone|Burning Desert}} of [[Crimson Isle]].  

== Spawning ==
The Barbarian Duke X spawns in {{zone|The Dukedom}} in the Barbarian Faction side of the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Behavior ==
The '''Barbarian Duke X''' can only be hit inside the '''Flame Domain''', a circle of particles around part of {{Zone|The Dukedom}}. It normally runs towards nearby players, dealing {{Stat|dmg|4,500}} on hit. 

It also has multiple abilities:
*'''Leap''' - It will occasionally create a circle of purple particles in an area of the arena and jump into the air, landing in the circle. Any players in the circle when it lands will take {{Stat|dmg}}, have their FOVs zoomed in, and will be unable to move for a few seconds afterward. The frequency and speed of these attacks increase as the Barbarian Duke X's {{Stat|hp}} lowers.
**If the boss goes out of the Flame Domain, the radius of its attack will be increased to almost the entire arena.
*'''Flaming Fist''' - Shoots many Flaming Fists outward when a player is in close range. They deal {{Stat|dmg}} on hit.

